hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2859","Sa'eed bin Hilal ne riwayat ki ke Jabir bin Abdullah Al-Ansari ne farmaya: \Ek din Rasoolullah (ﷺ) humare paas nikle aur farmabaya: 'Jab main so raha tha to ek khwab mein mujhe is tarah dikha gaya goya Jibra'il (Alaihis Salaam) mere paas the. Un mein se ek ne apne saathi se kaha: uske liye ek misaal bayaan karo.' To us ne kaha: 'Sun tere kaanon ke liye sunai de. Goshguzar kar tere dil ke liye samajh le! Tera aur teri Ummat ki misaal us badshah ki misaal hai jisne ek mulk par qabza kar liya.'\"""""""
"2860","Abu 'Uthman An-Nahdi ne Ibn Mas'ud (رضي الله عنه) se riwayat ki, unhone farmaya: \Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne 'Isha ki namaz padhi...\"""""""
"2861","Jabir bin Abdullah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \myry awr mjh say phlay walay anbyaa (alyhm alslam) ky msal as shkhs ky sy hay js nay ayk mkan bnaya۔ as nay asay mkml kya awr asay khwb achha bnaya۔\"""""""
"2862","Hazrat Haarith Al-Ash'ari (Razi Allahu Anho) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Beshak Allah Ta'ala ne Yahya bin Zakariyya (Alaihimus Salaam) ko paanch hukm diye thein ke un par amal karte rahein"""""
"2863","Ḥadīth Tarjumah\n\nBismillāhir-Raḥmānir-Raḥīm\n\nḤaddathanā Muḥammad ibn Bashshār, ḥaddathanā Yaḥyā ibn Saʿīd al-Qaṭṭān, ʿan Thābit ibn ʿImāra al-Ḥanafī, ʿan Ghunaym ibn Qays, ʿan Abū Mūsā, ʿan an-Nabiyy ﷺ, qāla:\n\n\Kullu ʿaynīn zāniyah"","" wa idhā al-marʾatu taṭayyabat wa marrat bi-maḥfaẓatin fa-hādhihi bi-hādhā\"" — yaʿnī"","" zāniyah.\n\nQāla Abū ʿĪsā (at-Tirmidhī): Fī hādha al-ʿanwāri ḥadīthun ʿan Abī Hurayrah — raḍiya ʿLlāhu ʿanhu. Qāla Abū ʿĪsā: Hādhā ḥadīthun ḥasanun ṣaḥīḥ.\n\n\n\n*Ḥāshiyah: Hādhā al-ḥadīthu muddawwan fī Sunan at-Tirmidhī"","" wa-yataʿallaqu bi-mabdiʿ al-ḥayāʾi al-Islāmī wa-ijtinābi al-fitnah"","" wa-yuʾakkidu anna al-ẓarfa nafsahu zinā al-ʿaynayn"","" kamā tabayyana fī riwāyāt ukhrā mashhūrah"","" wa-anna khurūj al-marʾati bi-ṭībin ẓāhirin yaḥmilu wazran akhlāqiyyan mithlan fī ḥadd al-fitnah.*"""""
"2864","Abu Musa Al-Ash'ari (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \jw momn qraan mjyd ky tlawt krta hay، as ky msal trnj (ayk qsm ka mytha lymwn) ky sy hay۔\"""""""
"2865","Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ nay frmaya: \mwmn ky msal ayk pwday ky sy hay؛ hwa asay jhkaty rhty hay۔\"""""""
"2866","Ibn 'Umar (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Yaqeenan ek darakht hai jo apne patte nahi gira karta.\"""""""
"2867","Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh (ﷺ) nay frmaya: \kya tm yh khyal krtay hw kh agr tm myn say ksy kay drwazay kay qryb ayk drya hw\"""""""
"2868","Hazrat Anas (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Meri Ummat ki misal barish ki misal hai; yeh maloom nahi ke iska aakhri hissa behtar hai ya awwal ka hissa.\"""""""
"2869","Hazrat Abdullah bin Buraidah (raziyallahu anhu) ne apni taraf se riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Kya tum jaante ho is aur is ki misal kya hai?\"" – aur unhon ne do kankriyan phenkin. Sab ne kaha: \""Allah aur uske Rasool (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) zyada jaante hain.\"" Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \""Yeh (door wali) ummat ki umeed hai.\"""""""
"2870","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se rivayat hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Tumhari muddat"","" pichli ummaton ki muddaton ke muqabil mein...\"""""""
"2871","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) se marwi hai ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Log sirf sau oonton ki tarah hain.\"""""""
"2872","Hadith ka Tarjuma\n\nBahz ibn Hakim nay apnay wald say awr an kay wald nay apnay dada say rwayt ky، anhwn nay frmaya:\n\nmyn nay arz ky: \aay allh kay nby ﷺ! hmaray prday kay aazaa (shrm gahwn) myn say ksay chhpana chahyay awr ksay khwl dyna jayz hay؟\"" aap ﷺ nay frmaya: \""apnay prday kay aazaa ky hfazt krw، swayay apny bywy kay ya an kay jw tmharay dayyn hath ky mlkyt hwn (yany bandyan/qydy awrtyn)\""\n\nmyn nay arz ky: \""aay allh kay rswl ﷺ! agr lwg ayk dwsray kay qryb hwn (ayk dwsray kay sath rhyn)؟\"" aap ﷺ nay frmaya: \""agr tm as bat kw yqyny bna skw kh kwyy asay nh dykhay، tw kwyy asay nh dykhay\""\n\nmyn nay arz ky: \""aay allh kay nby ﷺ! agr hm myn say kwyy akyla hw؟\"" aap ﷺ nay frmaya: \""tw allh taalyٰ as say zyadh hqdar hay kh as kay samnay hyaa ky jayay\""\n\nabw aysyٰ (amam trmzy) nay frmaya: *yh ayk hsn (achhy) hdys hay\""*\n\n\n\nmakhz: snn trmzy\n\ndrjh bndy: hsn (Good) — amam abw aysyٰ trmzy rhmt allh alyh ky drjh bndy kay mtabq۔"""""
"2873","Abu Hurairah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya ke Rasoolullah (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \Meri aur meri Ummat ki misaal us aadmi ki misaal hai jis ne aag jalai...\"""""""
"2874","Abu Hurairah (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ aby bn kab (rz all anh) kay pas tshryf layay۔"
